  "body": "Recently in order to address #9502, @annevk sent a PR #9751 which updates the location (and version) of the MathML specification.  However, the previous links were from the 2006ish era in which they were integrated when there was a single MathML specification.  A lot has happened since then, including the development of a separate specification called [MathML-Core](https://w3c.github.io/mathml-core/) which reflects what is designed for browsers and how it is integrates with the web platform.  The new links added in #9751 though are from what is now sometimes called \"MathML Full\" which includes... well... a lot more.  I've had it on my list for a while to send some PRs to update those references and I'm happy to do so if we agree that's what we should do... \r\n\r\n",
